label thursday:
    scene cameradisordinata with fade
    play sound audio.dispositivi_sveglia
    "Ungh..."
    "..."
    "Where am I?"
    "This is my room... I feel dizzy."
    "What was I doing yesterday?"
    "I just cannot remember. I should go down and try eating something."

    scene cucina giorno with fade
    show elise casual huh_2 with dissolve
    "What...?! Why is Elise sleeping on my table?!"
    play music audio.souls.delicata_e_eccentrica fadein(5.0)
    l "Who's there..."
    l "..."
    m "..."
    l casual shock_1 "[nome_protagonista]... what... what are you doing here?!"
    m "I'd ask the same question, as this is... you know... my kitchen's table..."
    l "... WHAT?!"
    "She jumped out of the chair, stumbled and was falling. I catched her in my arms."
    l casual shock_2 "...T-thank you..."
    "As she regained her balance, I left her barely standing on her feet."
    l casual pout_4 "I feel dizzy... I even can't remember how I got here..."
    m "What's the first thing you remember? I can just remember leaving Café Memoria on yesterday evening. Nothing beyond that."
    l casual pout_3 "Uhm... I was... just waiting at my place."
    "I maybe could prepare breakfast, in the meantime."
    m "Would you like some good soya milk and coffee with them?"
    l casual tears_4 "I'd love it."
    m "Are you feeling better now?"
    l casual smile_4 "I feel way better. Thanks."
    m "So, how about your day? Was it fun?"
    play sound audio.cucina_tazzina_rumorosa
    l casual sad_3 "..."
    m "Uhm?"
    l casual "I just..."
    m "You just...?"
    play sound audio.cucina_tazzina_rumorosa
    l casual "I just waited."
    m "Uh? Waited?"
    play sound audio.cucina_cucchiaino_rumoroso
    l casual sweat_1 "N-nothing, I mean, I'm just waiting for our breakfast..."
    m "Oh...! You must be starving!"
    l casual pout_1 "N-no, that's not the point...!"
    m "So what?"
    play sound audio.cucina_cucchiaino_rumoroso
    l casual angry_3 "Well then, I'll say it."
    m "Say what?"
    l casual pout_4 "...for you."
    "What did she just whispered?"
    l casual pout_4 "Pff. I was just waiting for you!"
    m "Uh?"
    l casual angry_3 "I WAS WAITING FOR YOU!"
    m "O-OH!"
    m "Here's the hot milk & coffee!"
    play sound audio.cucina_versare
    l casual smile_5 "Thanks, [nome_protagonista]!"
    m "Let's eat!"
    l casual smile_3 "Let's eat!"
    "As I sat down, I just felt at home. There really was everything I needed."
    "Should I talk with her about the plan?"
    l casual smile_6 "Oh, they're so good!"
    m "I'm glad you like them!"
    "No, it's not a good moment. We're so happy now."
    play sound audio.cucina_cucchiaino_modesto
    l casual smile_2 "The hot milk & coffee is good too."
    "I think I just let it slip away."
    m "Oh, thanks!"
    "Maybe I could even let the whole plan slip away."
    "I don't care about truth, after all."

    show norman deadend surprised_1 at right with dissolve

    stop music

    n "Oh no, there's a loop here."
    n deadend default_1 "Let's fix this."
    show elise deadend casual smile_2 with hpunch
    n deadend smirk_1 "Out of your mind! I'm sorry, Lily, but he just can't think about you now."
    show norman deadend smirk_1 at center with moveinleft
    show elise deadend casual smile_2 at right with moveoutright
    n deadend default_1 "Then... well, this should work."
    play music audio.light_amici
    show norman smile_3 with dissolve

    n "Let's eat!"
    m "Oh well... yeah, let's do it! It will be a long day."
    l deadend casual shock_1 "Hey! What's happening here...? Why am I standing?"
    "Today is the day of the plan. Newz is picking me up, and we're going to school together. This is so unlikely!"
    n "A good cappuccino here! The flavor's particular."
    m "It's soya milk."
    "Wait, why am I using soya milk? Hmm..."
    l "What is Norman doing here, [nome_protagonista]?"
    n "AAAANYWAYS! Let's eat quick and go out, or we risk being late!"
    m "Of course! Thank you for coming picking me up."
    n smile_3 "Thank you for the good starting meal!"
    m "*glub glub* Aaah! Well, let's get going!"
    l "What...? [nome_protagonista], why are you ignoring me?"

    scene appartamento mattina with dissolve

    show norman smile_3 with dissolve

    n "Follow me! Let's get going!"
    m "Yeah, let's go."

    "I hope I'll be able to meet Elise, today. I really need to talk with her."

    scene black with fade

    "We got to school in a while, grouped and left. I was not able to see the other class, as they departed with a different bus, while we were grouped with Newz's class."

    "Finally, we arrived!"

    scene villaggio giorno with fade
    show norman smile_1 at left with dissolve
    show bianca default_1 at center with dissolve
    show edward default_1 at right with dissolve

    b "Here we are."
    e "It has been a fairly long trip."
    n smirk_1 "Do you all remember our plan?"
    b smile_1 "Of course."
    e smile_1 "I do. And you, [nome_protagonista]?"
    m "Yes, I remember our plan. Though, I was wondering... should I get into action alone just after the visit?"
    b talk_1 "Yes, you should. We'll be watching you, so don't worry."
    m "Okay... so, let's hope for the best."

    scene villaggio giorno with fade

    "Oh, here she is. The visit is about to be over, I should get to her and talk."
    m "Hi Elise. How are you?"

    show elise shock_2 with dissolve

    l shock_2 "..."
    m "Lily?"
    l angry_1 "..."
    m "W-what's the matter?"
    l angry_2 "Please, go away."
    m "W-WHAT?! W-why?"
    "Does she know about the plan already??"
    l angry_4 "You ignored be all this morning, and did everything as I wasn't there when Norman showed up."
    "What? Is she mad?"
    m "What? You weren't there at all! You never came! Or, if you came, I never heard you arriving."
    l angry_3 "That's impossible. I was there until... until..."
    show gain default_1 at right with dissolve
    g "Oh. It's you. We must talk."
    "Oh shit! It's him! What does he mean by that? He's gonna isolate me. I must be on guard."
    m "Just tell me. What's the matter in telling here?"
    g "I can't tell here. Just follow me. Please."
    "I still can't recall the scene in which me and Elise were attacked."
    "He was the one not mentioning that we were together."
    "He must also have tricked Edward and other people into thinking that they're engaged."
    "This must be because he wants to oversee her. To know if she can recall things."
    "He's overseeing me as well. This time he may want to take me out for good, as he cannot interact with me that often."
    m "I'm not following you anywhere, so just speak your thing."
    g angry_2 "... You're being manipulated."
    "What's this now?"
    m "And by who, exactly?"
    g angry_3 "By your friends."
    "Yeah, sure."
    m "Again with this nonsense."
    g angry_2 "You're going to make the wrong choice. I know they're up to something."
    m "The wrong choice would be to follow a creep like you!"
    g angry_1 "Why are you always around Elise? Just get away from her!"
    m "HOW DARE YOU! We're a couple!"
    l shock_1 "... What?"
    m "What am I saying?"
    show villaggio giorno with hpunch
    "What's up? My head is swirling again."
    "I just... I just seems my memories are scrambled... it's nauseating..."
    g surprised_1 "Uh? ...what's this, now? Are you okay?"
    m "I'm not... I'm not okay... and that's because you... you..."
    g lookaway_1 "There's something completely off. I've seen this face painted on Lily too. What's about all of this? Why is this happening?"
    "Why is this... happening? It was a fair question, even if it was coming out of his mouth."
    "In the mean time, students spreaded out. The tour was over."
    l scared_1 "I'm worried, Gain... I feel I can't remember something. Something important."
    g default_1 "Well. Let's seat together, then. I think we might've been manipulated too. Let's sit and thing. We need a clear view."
    "Seating seemed a nice idea, as the world was spinning. I sat."
    m "Well... what do you know, Gain? I know you're hiding things, so, show them up."
    g default_1 "I think there may be no point in hiding things among us, after all. Very well, then. I'll tell you everything."
    g default_1 "Just, after you get to know this, keep your guard up."
    m "Just speak, please."
    g angry_2 "Very well. I'll keep this short. Someone was following Elise, on tuesday evening."
    m "Oh, I remember something about this. She said she was afraid of something."
    g angry_3 "I was well prepared, as I sensed that something was about to happen. So I tailed him, or her."
    m "And?"
    g angry_2 "I was reaching the shadow, but I was being tailed too."
    "Is he talking about Norman spotting him?"
    m "Uhm. And what did you do?"
    g "I tried to get loose of him, but it was hard. I had to keep my eye over Elise, to keep her safe."
    "While following her with a gun?"
    l embarassed_2 "Me and Gain know each other since childhood. He's always watching over me."
    "This sounds true, though. Is he a stalker of some sort?"
    g "I thought it was far too dangerous, so I called Elise by phone, and asked her to go to your place. I managed to get rid of the person following me, while taking him or her away from Elise."
    g "Elise did manage to get to your place, so everything went fine."
    l "Wait, Gain, I can't recall that."
    g "Recall what?"
    l "That you called me. I... recall that... I called Norman, instead..."
    g "May have you called him later?"
    l "No, I think I called him to find out what was [nome_protagonista]'s adddress..."
    g "I just told you that. Why did you ask Norman?"
    l "Uh? I... don't know?"
    g "Again, there's something off. It's happening quite often. It happens every time I get closer to the truth."
    m "How can you know my home address?"
    g "Uh? Isn't it obvious? We're neighbours."
    m "Oh, I don't even know that. How comes you know?"
    g "What are you saying? We... were friends when we were children. Can't you remember that?"
    "I tried to remind that. Nothing came up to my mind."
    m "I can't."
    "Something *is* off, though. I feel the same way since... when I lost my memories."
    g surprised_2 "Damn...! I got to go for a second. Please, you two, wait for me here."
    "He was checking his trousers, and skipped away after saying that. What was he looking for?"
    "...! Could it be he was looking for... his {b}gun{/b}?!"
    "Oh, but it really didn't matter! That was the occasion I was waiting for!"
    m "Lily, I need to talk with you. It's a... private thing, so, may you follow me?"
    l "B-but... Gain asked us to wait him."
    m "We'll be back, you can text him after we've talked that we're coming back in a while."
    l "Uhm... I'm not comfortable with that, but... if you really need this... I trust you."

    jump deadend_2
